{
  "info": {
    "_postman_id": "nexa-clinic-api-collection",
    "name": "Nexa Clinic - REST API Collection",
    "description": "Dokumentasi lengkap REST API untuk Sistem Informasi Klinik Nexa Clinic.\n\nBase URL: http://localhost:5000\n\nCara penggunaan:\n1. Jalankan backend server: cd backend && npm run dev\n2. Login menggunakan endpoint Auth/Login untuk mendapatkan token JWT\n3. Copy token dari response, lalu paste ke variabel {{token}} di Collection Variables\n4. Semua endpoint yang membutuhkan autentikasi akan otomatis menggunakan token tersebut\n\nAkun Default:\n- Admin: username=admin, password=password123\n- Dokter: username=dokter, password=password123\n- Pendaftaran: username=pendaftaran, password=password123",
    "schema": "https://schema.getpostman.com/json/collection/v2.1.0/collection.json"
  },
  "variable": [
    {
      "key": "base_url",
      "value": "http://localhost:5000",
      "type": "string"
    },
    {
      "key": "token",
      "value": "",
      "type": "string",
      "description": "JWT Token hasil login. Isi setelah berhasil login."
    }
  ],
  "item": [
    {
      "name": "🔐 Auth - Autentikasi",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Login",
          "event": [
            {
              "listen": "test",
              "script": {
                "exec": [
                  "if (pm.response.code === 200) {",
                  "    const res = pm.response.json();",
                  "    if (res.data && res.data.token) {",
                  "        pm.collectionVariables.set('token', res.data.token);",
                  "        console.log('Token berhasil disimpan ke variabel collection!');",
                  "    }",
                  "}"
                ],
                "type": "text/javascript"
              }
            }
          ],
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Content-Type", "value": "application/json" }
            ],
            "body": {
              "mode": "raw",
              "raw": "{\n    \"username\": \"admin\",\n    \"password\": \"password123\"\n}"
            },
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/login",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "login"]
            },
            "description": "Login untuk mendapatkan JWT Token. Token akan otomatis tersimpan ke variabel {{token}} jika berhasil."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Get Current User (Me)",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/me",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "me"]
            },
            "description": "Mendapatkan data profil user yang sedang login berdasarkan JWT token."
          },
          "response": []
        },
        {
          "name": "Logout",
          "request": {
            "method": "POST",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/logout",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "logout"]
            },
            "description": "Logout dan invalidasi sesi aktif user."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "📊 Dashboard - Statistik",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get Dashboard Summary",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
              { "key": "Authorization", "value": "Bearer {{token}}" }
            ],
            "url": {
              "raw": "{{base_url}}/api/dashboard/summary",
              "host": ["{{base_url}}"],
              "path": ["api", "dashboard", "summary"]
            },
            "description": "Mendapatkan statistik ringkasan: total pasien, kunjungan hari ini, antrean aktif, dan pendapatan."
          },
          "response": []
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "👥 Patients - Master Data Pasien",
      "item": [
        {
          "name": "Get All Patients",
          "request": {
            "method": "GET",
            "header": [
